ustrator":"Nafisa Nandini Crishna","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":6,"title":"Fish and frogs","illustrator":"Nafisa Nandini Crishna","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":7,"title":"Rabbits and rats in their habitat","illustrator":"Nafisa Nandini Crishna","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":8,"title":"Monkeys and apes","illustrator":"Nafisa Nandini Crishna","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":9,"title":"Bears outside a cave","illustrator":"Nafisa Nandini Crishna","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":10,"title":"A crocodile","illustrator":"Nafisa Nandini Crishna","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":11,"title":"Deer and tigers in a forest","illustrator":"Nafisa Nandini Crishna","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":12,"title":"A house in the forest","illustrator":"Nafisa Nandini Crishna","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-16"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/61459-praanigala-manegalu/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಮ್ಮ ಸುತ್ತಮುತ್ತ ಪ್ರಾಣಿಗಳಿವೆ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/61459-praanigala-manegalu/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಪಕ್ಷಿಗಳು ಕಟ್ಟುವವು ಮರದಲಿ ಮನೆ.","ಜೇನುಹುಳುಗಳೂ."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/61459-praanigala-manegalu/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಹೆಣೆದು ಕಟ್ಟುವ ಮನೆ ಜೇಡದ್ದು.","ಚಿಕ್ಕ ಗೆದ್ದಲು ಹುಳುಗಳದು ದೊಡ್ಡ ಮನೆ."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/61459-praanigala-manegalu/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಬಸವನ ಹುಳುಗಳು, ಆಮೆಗಳು ಹೋದಲ್ಲೆಲ್ಲಾ ಅವುಗಳ ಮನೆಯನು ಹೊತ್ತು ತಿರುಗುವವು."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/61459-praanigala-manegalu/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮೀನು ನೀರಲ್ಲಿ ವಾಸಿಸುತ್ತೆ.","ಕಪ್ಪೆ ನೀರಲೂ, ನೆಲದಲೂ."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/61459-praanigala-manegalu/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಮೊಲ, ಇಲಿಗಳಿಗೆ ನೆಲದಲಿ ಬಿಲ."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/61459-praanigala-manegalu/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮಂಗ, ಕಪಿಗಳಿಗೆ ಮರವೇ ಮನೆ."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/61459-praanigala-manegalu/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಕರಡಿ, ತೋಳಗಳು ಗುಹೆಯಲಿ."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/61459-praanigala-manegalu/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮೊಸಳೆಗಳು ಕೆಸರಲಿ."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/61459-praanigala-manegalu/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಜಿಂಕೆಗಳ ವಾಸ ಕಾಡಲಿ.","ಹುಲಿಗಳದೂ!"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/61459-praanigala-manegalu/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಕೆಲ ಪ್ರಾಣಿಗಳು ನಮ್ಮ ನಡುವೆಯೇ ವಾಸಿಸಿದರೆ, ಇನ್ನೂ ಕೆಲವು ದೂರದಲೆಲ್ಲೋ ತಮ್ಮದೇ ಜಾಗ ಮಾಡಿಕೊಳುವವು.","ಪ್ರಪಂಚದ ಎಲ್ಲ ಪ್ರಾಣಿ, ಪಕ್ಷಿಗಳಲ್ಲಿರುವ ಸಾಮಾನ್ಯ ಸಂಗತಿ ಏನು ಗೊತ್ತೆ?","ಒಂದು ವಿಶಾಲವಾದ ಮನೆ","ನಾವು ನಮ್ಮ ಪುಟ್ಟ ಪುಟ್ಟ ಮನೆಗಳನ್ನು ಒಂದು ದೊಡ್ಡ ಮನೆಯೊಳಗೆ ಕಟ್ಟಿಕೊಂಡಿದ್ದೇವೆ: ಆ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಮನೆಯೇ ಭೂಮಿ ಎಂಬ ಗ್ರಹ!"]}],"wordCount":85}